## 9. Violations and Termination

On the first written notice of a violation of these terms, your license
continues if you come into full compliance and correct past violations
within 32 days of that notice. Otherwise, all licenses granted to you
under these terms end immediately. Use for a Commercial Purpose without
a separate written license from the licensor is a violation from the
moment it begins.

